# M5b's short window (plan section 6): at 1100 x 720 the panel (460 x 612 from (16, 92)) is
# shorter than its cards and scrolls (FunctionViewer.module.css .panel, overflow-y: auto). The
# wheel over the panel's left padding (x 25, between its edge at 16 and the cards at 35, so no
# row is hovered) scrolls it to its foot: 1000 px down is more than it can go in every engine
# (Chromium delivers Playwright's wheel at half its delta under a device scale of 2). No
# scrollbar shows (plan call 7).
size 1100 720
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
shot short-top
move 25 400
wheel 0 1000
wait 16
shot short
